    "greeting": {
      "title": "CEO Message",
      "body": "Your compressed air partner for stable production\nThank you for visiting Hankook Service Center.\nHankook Service Center provides compressed air solutions for industrial sites from air compressor sales to maintenance, repair, and overhaul.\nA stable compressed air supply is essential to protecting productivity and quality. We carefully understand each customer’s equipment and operating environment, and work to reduce unexpected downtime and improve efficiency through site-fit technical support and responsive service.\n\nWe value every commitment to our customers and continue responsible service after delivery. With technical capability and trust, we aim to be a reliable partner so you can focus on production with confidence.\nWe look forward to your continued interest and support.\nThank you."
    },
